      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Security\n----------\n- Explicit timeout per execution\n- CPU and memory bounds\n- READ only file system (write to tmp)\n- Network isolation (VPC) - no database access.\n- No system calls.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
