      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "To handle synchronous response requirement (success/failure) for an async code execution mechanims:\n1. Create webSocket/SSE to client (over engineering, introduces extra infra and make servers statefull).\n2. Long polling on clients end.\n\nNew API required for polling; [GET /problems/:problemId/submissions/:submissionId]",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "To handle synchronous response requirement (success/failure) for an async code execution mechanims:\n1. Create webSocket/SSE to client (over engineering, introduces extra infra and make servers statefull).\n2. Long polling on clients end.\n\nNew API required for polling; [GET /problems/:problemId/submissions/:submissionId]",
